I actually quite like this idea. Set the intrinsic resistances so that
they max out at 80%, but keep extrinsic resistances at 100%. Add a
couple more items that provide extrinsic resistances (asbestos cloak,
rubber gloves... in fact, maybe tie some of the resistant items to
randomized appearance rather than make entirely new items) and
suddenly you've added an extra little bit of thought and variance to
the ascension kit.

Of course this also might well render Dragonbane the best weapon in
the game rather than just (arguably) the best weapon for the early
game.




